```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Buyer as 买家
    participant Store as 店面 (Worker)
    participant Stripe as Stripe
    participant DB as D1 (cards/orders)
    participant Bot as Devin Bot

    Buyer->>Store: 下单 (sku, 金额)
    Store->>DB: 查 kill switch + 心跳
    alt 开关开着 / 心跳断了
        Store->>Buyer: 503，挂维护页，不收单
    else 正常
        Store->>DB: 创建订单 pending
        Store->>Stripe: 创建 PaymentIntent
        Buyer->>Stripe: 付款
        Stripe->>Store: webhook payment_intent.succeeded
        Store->>DB: 事务锁一张卡 (unsold → locked)
        Store->>DB: 发卡 (locked → issued)，写审计日志
        Store->>Buyer: 返回卡密
    end

    Bot->>Store: 每 5 分钟心跳
    Bot->>DB: 扫异常单：付款成功未发卡 / 风控 held 单
    alt 有库存
        Bot->>DB: 重发一次
    else 缺货
        Bot->>Stripe: 自动退款，订单改 refunded
    end
    Bot->>DB: 晚上对账：Stripe 流水 vs D1 状态
    Bot->>Buyer: 对不上就标出来，第二天早上人工看

    Note over Store,Bot: kill switch 跳闸后：只进不出，恢复必须人工点
```
